    "body": "fix on issue/1509-adaptive-trochoid-method · PR #1598 · pinned by motion `adaptive_troch` tests (12), app `adaptive_trochoid` (5, golden `adaptive2d_trochoidal_pocket_face.cl`), ui `adaptive_method` (2) · merges at the next cut (`feat`)\n\nRefs only: this is the 2D Adaptive slice (Method = Spiral | Trochoidal, one lane along the region's medial line, confined and refused by name). Still owed, filed as sub-issues: #1587 (wide and branching regions), #1588 (trochoidal parameters on the page), #1590 (the stand-alone Trochoidal slot's future - kept as it is for now, decision in `docs/decisions/1509-adaptive-trochoid-method.md`), #1591 (3D Adaptive). Bug found on the way: #1589 (the stand-alone slot leaves a post at its start when its loop band is wider than the tool).\n",
